docs {
  # Dashboard

  Read-only, always-derived insights for the Home screen: a summary of the library, reading
  statistics split by format, and the most recently recorded resources. Nothing is stored or
  cached; every number is computed from the reader's own records on each request.

  Run the folder in order. **Register dashboard reader** creates its own disposable account,
  checks the empty dashboard, then builds a small library (a physical book read once and now
  reread, an unread ebook, a note, a highlight, a wish and two loans, one returned) so the
  filled dashboard has known values. It is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Dashboard").
}
